WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.546
The incident response lifecycle becomes most useful when teams apply it as an operating routine.

00:00:06.546 --> 00:00:11.272
Prepare before incidents happen by defining roles, playbooks, tools, logging, backups,

00:00:11.272 --> 00:00:12.561
and escalation paths.

00:00:12.561 --> 00:00:16.858
Detect suspicious activity through alerts, reports, telemetry, and business signals.

00:00:16.858 --> 00:00:21.585
Analyze the evidence to understand severity, scope, affected assets, affected accounts,

00:00:21.585 --> 00:00:23.304
business impact, and confidence.

00:00:23.304 --> 00:00:29.320
Contain safely to limit spread or harm while preserving evidence and considering business continuity.

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:33.617
Eradicate the cause by fixing the system, account, configuration, process,

00:00:33.617 --> 00:00:37.484
or access path that allowed the incident to continue.

00:00:37.484 --> 00:00:40.492
Recover trusted operations through validation, monitoring, coordination,

00:00:40.492 --> 00:00:41.781
and clear communication.

00:00:41.781 --> 00:00:45.649
Document decisions from the beginning, not after memory fades.

00:00:45.649 --> 00:00:50.805
Review lessons learned and turn them into improvements to controls, detections, playbooks,

00:00:50.805 --> 00:00:52.953
access, backups, training, and ownership.

00:00:52.953 --> 00:00:55.961
Incident response is not only technical cleanup.

00:00:55.961 --> 00:00:58.540
It is coordinated decision-making under uncertainty.

00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:02.407
A mature team reduces harm, restores trust, communicates responsibly,

00:01:02.407 --> 00:01:05.415
and uses every incident to improve resilience.

00:01:05.415 --> 00:01:09.282
The routine is intentionally simple because incidents are not.

00:01:09.282 --> 00:01:15.298
It gives responders a common language when facts are incomplete and pressure is high.

00:01:15.298 --> 00:01:21.314
Used well, it helps a team move deliberately: gather evidence, decide what matters now,

00:01:21.314 --> 00:01:26.900
act with authorization, validate the result, and turn the experience into stronger readiness.
